# Real data / backups — never commit anything that could hold real financial data.
# This is a backstop, not a substitute for checking `git status` before committing.
# (Targets file extensions/dirs, not src/export or src/storage source code.)
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.enc
*.locked
*.csv
/backups/
/data/
fixtures/local/

